{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20349",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 5.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Mm, hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.99,
      "end_seconds": 11.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.95,
      "end_seconds": 26.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.25,
      "text": "Actually, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. It's a lump near my back passage, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.31,
      "end_seconds": 28.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.53,
      "end_seconds": 33.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Hmm, about a week, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 35.98,
      "end_seconds": 39.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.48,
      "end_seconds": 45.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.06,
      "end_seconds": 54.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "That sounds about right. I've also had hard stools, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.82,
      "end_seconds": 58.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Have you had discomfort when sitting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.52,
      "end_seconds": 64.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.36,
      "end_seconds": 71.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Have you noticed change in bowel habit, black stools or severe pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.4,
      "end_seconds": 82.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Well, no change in bowel habit, black stools or severe pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.68,
      "end_seconds": 87.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss, fever or dizziness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.42,
      "end_seconds": 93.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Uh, no, no weight loss, fever or dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.21,
      "end_seconds": 97.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.9,
      "end_seconds": 100.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.43,
      "end_seconds": 106.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.13,
      "end_seconds": 110.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.37,
      "end_seconds": 114.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.18,
      "end_seconds": 126.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "I've had low haemoglobin, yes. I've been putting this off for weeks. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.29,
      "end_seconds": 128.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.11,
      "end_seconds": 138.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.59,
      "end_seconds": 142.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.1,
      "end_seconds": 148.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Okay, I can see low haemoglobin and acid reflux in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.57,
      "end_seconds": 159.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.47,
      "end_seconds": 163.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.97,
      "end_seconds": 167.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.48,
      "end_seconds": 175.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.87,
      "end_seconds": 179.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.72,
      "end_seconds": 185.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.24,
      "end_seconds": 187.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.26,
      "end_seconds": 191.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.84,
      "end_seconds": 195.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.31,
      "end_seconds": 200.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.52,
      "end_seconds": 206.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.49,
      "end_seconds": 213.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.7,
      "end_seconds": 218.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.2,
      "end_seconds": 222.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "About about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.74,
      "end_seconds": 223.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.09,
      "end_seconds": 231.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Oh, I take omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day for the reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 233.28,
      "end_seconds": 244.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Ah, doctor, I think the last prescription for the omeprazole was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.02,
      "end_seconds": 249.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.85,
      "end_seconds": 257.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Mm, not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 264.49,
      "end_seconds": 275.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse is 72 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, blood pressure 125 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.26,
      "end_seconds": 278.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "So, good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.74,
      "end_seconds": 282.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.61,
      "end_seconds": 291.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.55,
      "end_seconds": 296.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Right, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.72,
      "end_seconds": 319.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "There is a small soft lump at the edge of the anus and no tear that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.0,
      "end_seconds": 333.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is haemorrhoids. We shouldn't forget a polyp in the bowel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.22,
      "end_seconds": 337.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.07,
      "end_seconds": 367.63,
      "duration_seconds": 28.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like haemorrhoids, but I'd like to confirm. I'm sending you for a blood count because of rectal bleeding. I'm sending you for a camera test of the bowel because of rectal bleeding. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. What I'm giving you is haemorrhoid cream, twice a day, for a week. It's for haemorrhoids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.83,
      "end_seconds": 372.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.35,
      "end_seconds": 387.22,
      "duration_seconds": 13.87,
      "text": "Fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.53,
      "end_seconds": 394.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Alright, um, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.19,
      "end_seconds": 411.13,
      "duration_seconds": 15.94,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint. In that case don't wait. We'll catch up after the camera test. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.01,
      "end_seconds": 420.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.81,
      "end_seconds": 423.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}